# Belt-and-braces on top of .gitignore.
#
# This one line is load-bearing: if .env.local ever reached Vercel, Next.js
# would read it at build and runtime and the public deployment would run the
# intent check live on the owner's own API key — the exact opposite of demo
# mode, and it would burn their credits on every visitor.
.env
.env.*

node_modules
.next
docs
tests
.playwright-mcp
AGENTGUARD_SPEC.md
